 (QLoRA-able); small model is harness-debug only

Verified Qwen3.6 has no small variant: only Qwen3.6-27B (dense) + 35B-A3B (MoE) as
trainable base safetensors (cache had only GGUF; safetensors downloadable). 27B is
QLoRA-able on one 3090 (4-bit ~14GB). Plan: validate the NEW fine-tune harness on a tiny
fixture (Qwen3.5-0.8B, fast iteration) then run the headline on Qwen3.6-27B QLoRA. Small
model = harness-debug fixture, NOT the claim.

